---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MenuButton from '../components/MenuButton';
const nav = [['Platform','#platform'],['For Individuals','#individuals'],['For Business','#business'],['Developers','#developers'],['Trust & Security','#trust'],['Help','#help']];
---
<BaseLayout>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="ePahichan home"><span class="mark">e</span>Pahichan</a>
    <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">{nav.map(([label,href]) => <a href={href}>{label}</a>)}</nav>
    <a class="header-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><MenuButton client:load />
  </header>
  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Digital trust, made more approachable</p><h1 id="hero-heading">A clearer way to connect with <em>digital trust.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">ePahichan is being shaped as a simpler experience for people, organizations, and the developers who build the services they rely on.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#contact">Register your interest <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#platform">Explore ePahichan <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sun"></div><div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><div class="identity-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-dot"></span><span>ePahichan</span></div><div class="card-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="card-seal">✓</div></div><p class="art-caption">Built for everyday connections.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="intro section" id="platform" aria-labelledby="platform-heading"><p class="eyebrow">One connected experience</p><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="platform-heading">Designed around the people and systems that need to work together.</h2><p>ePahichan brings a human-facing experience and integration-ready services under one simple, recognizable brand.</p></div><div class="path-grid"><article class="path-card"><span class="path-number">01</span><div><h3>For individuals</h3><p>A mobile-first experience being designed to make digital trust easier to understand and use.</p><a href="#individuals">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="path-card"><span class="path-number">02</span><div><h3>For organizations</h3><p>Flexible integration foundations for institutions building experiences of their own.</p><a href="#business">For business →</a></div></article><article class="path-card"><span class="path-number">03</span><div><h3>For developers</h3><p>Clear documentation and sandbox tools are planned for teams bringing ePahichan into their software.</p><a href="#developers">For developers →</a></div></article></div></section>
    <section class="split-section section" id="individuals"><div class="device-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="phone"><div class="phone-pill"></div><span class="phone-mark">e</span><b>Your ePahichan</b><div class="phone-panel"><span>Designed for you</span><i></i><i></i></div></div></div><div class="split-copy"><p class="eyebrow">For individuals</p><h2>Built to feel simple, from the first step.</h2><p>ePahichan is planned as a mobile-first experience for people who want a more straightforward way to engage with digital services.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Keep me informed →</a></div></section>
    <section class="business section" id="business"><p class="eyebrow">For business</p><div class="section-heading"><h2>Make trust a natural part of your own experience.</h2><p>Organizations remain in control of the journeys they create for customers and teams. ePahichan is being built to support thoughtful integrations, not replace your way of working.</p></div><div class="business-points"><span>Built around your workflows</span><span>Designed for connected services</span><span>Made for teams that build</span></div></section>
    <section class="developers section" id="developers"><div><p class="eyebrow">For developers</p><h2>Tools that respect your time.</h2><p>Developer documentation, a sandbox, and integration resources are in development. Join the list to hear when they are ready to explore.</p><a class="button button-light" href="#contact">Developer updates →</a></div><div class="code-window" aria-label="Illustrative integration window"><div class="code-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p>Build experiences around people.<br /><br />Documentation and sandbox access are coming soon.</p></div></section>
    <section class="trust section" id="trust"><p class="eyebrow">Trust &amp; security</p><div class="section-heading"><h2>Thoughtful by design.</h2><p>We are taking a careful approach to the information, experiences, and relationships behind ePahichan. More detailed policy and trust information will be shared as it is reviewed and ready.</p></div><div class="trust-line"><span>Clear information</span><span>Respectful experiences</span><span>Built with care</span></div></section>
    <section class="contact section" id="contact"><p class="eyebrow">Stay close</p><h2>Let’s make the next connection a meaningful one.</h2><p>Whether you are exploring ePahichan for yourself, your organization, or your next integration, we would like to hear from you.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:hello@epahichan.com.np?subject=ePahichan%20interest">Contact ePahichan →</a><small>Contact details are an interest channel. Product access is not yet available.</small></section>
    <section class="help section" id="help"><p>Have a question? <a href="#contact">Start a conversation.</a></p></section>
  </main>
  <footer><a class="wordmark" href="#top"><span class="mark">e</span>Pahichan</a><p>Digital trust, made more approachable.</p><p class="footer-note">Public information is being introduced gradually. Legal, policy, and service details will be published when reviewed.</p><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} ePahichan</span></footer>
</BaseLayout>
